# tools/choose.py --state ny. Little Falls, German Flatts, Herkimer, Danube, Manheim, Fairfield, Salisbury, Newport,
# Norway, Russia (Cold Brook) and Warren (Jordanville). Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text
# (tools/wiki_raw.py), HMdb marker pages, the William G. Pomeroy Foundation, the American Canal Society's Erie Canal index
# sheet, eriecanal.org, the Little Falls Historical Society, Mohawk Valley Museums pages, the NY State Covered Bridge
# Society, Holy Trinity Monastery's visitor page and a few news pages, all through tools/page.py. The National Register
# form texts on npgallery came back as a one-page placeholder for every form tried, so no form was read.
